From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dwrite, d2d1: color glyph images (6007)

TranslateColorGlyphRun returns the image glyphs of a run (PNG, JPEG,
TIFF, SVG) as runs of their own format beside the outline and COLR runs;
Direct2D draws bitmap glyph runs (DrawColorBitmapGlyphRun,
GetColorBitmapGlyphImage) and DrawText with color fonts draws them (G-D2D).
---
